Sail: a picture-in-picture button on the videos in web pages, like Zen's. It
comes up at the right edge of the video under the mouse. It is a built-in
extension, packaged like Helium's //components/extstore_fixups. Its resource
ids come last in resource_ids.spec, so that adding it does not renumber the
resources of the rest of the browser.

